<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan FGEP passes on 54,000T U.S. corn tender.</title>
<headline>Taiwan FGEP passes on 54,000T U.S. corn tender.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's FGEP corn-buying group on Thursday passed on a tender for one 54,000-tonne shipment of U.S. corn, local traders said.  </p>
<p>No retender date has been set.</p>
<p>The FGEP group comprises Fwu Sow Grain, Great Wall Enterprise, President Enterprise, Ever Smile Feed Mill Co and Taiwan Fong Yu.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
